+# B01 任务、条件与官方配置
+
+## Profile and precedence
+
+Apply only when the adopted program has `sequence.flow_profile: work-harness-cd-v1`.
+Read [C/D math–code loop](../../cd-math-code-loop.md). This guide and the active
+catalog requirements override the historical [B01 registry entry](../B01.md)
+where C/D responsibilities or old Gate 0/IPCG prerequisites conflict. The legacy
+entry remains source provenance; it does not add the old gate chain to this profile.
+Other profiles retain their exact historical rules.
+
+## Work and evidence
+
+Restore the selected task and configured official assets. Reuse existing authorized target and successful setup evidence; do not repeat installation or make full scientific qualification a setup prerequisite. B01 retains its configuration-only route and existing explicit qualification controls.
+
